{"seq":3,"slug":"frontend-migration","title":"渐进式前端架构迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/frontend-migration","wordCount":1782,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"渐进式前端架构迁移\">渐进式前端架构迁移</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微前端是将微服务的<strong>独立部署与团队自治原则延伸到表现层</strong>的架构方案：它把一个庞大的前端单体按业务域切割为可独立构建、独立发布的子应用，由 Shell/Host 应用负责全局导航、认证与布局。实现上存在一条从&quot;构建时组合&quot;到&quot;运行时组合&quot;的技术光谱——NPM 包、Monorepo、Module Federation、qiankun/single-spa、iframe——<strong>独立性越高，隔离性与性能开销的取舍越明显</strong>。迁移的关键不是重写，而是在保持业务连续的前提下逐步解耦：先搭 Shell，再按域切割路由，最后实现独立 CI/CD。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前端单体的困境\">前端单体的困境</h2><p>当一个前端应用从数千行增长到数十万行代码，由 3 人小团队膨胀到 50+ 前端工程师协作时，SPA 单体的结构性瓶颈开始显现：构建时间从分钟级膨胀到 5-15 分钟，一次合并请求可能触发数百个不相关文件的回归测试，一个低优先级模块的 bug 修复需要等待下一个统一发布窗口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>痛点</th>\n<th>量化信号</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构建缓慢</td>\n<td><code>npm run build</code> &gt; 5min</td>\n<td>开发体验恶化，CI 超时频发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布阻塞</td>\n<td>发布需协调 3+ 团队</td>\n<td>功能延迟上线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术栈锁定</td>\n<td>无法引入新框架/新版本</td>\n<td>技术债务累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障扩散</td>\n<td>一个模块崩溃导致全站白屏</td>\n<td>可用性下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行开发冲突</td>\n<td>周度代码合并冲突 &gt; 5 次</td>\n<td>工程效率降低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>微前端架构是对这些问题的系统性回应——它将微服务的独立部署、团队自治原则延伸到表现层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微前端的核心模式\">微前端的核心模式</h2><p>2026 年的微前端实现已形成成熟的技术光谱：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 构建时组合&#10;        NpmPkg[NPM 包发布]&#10;        Monorepo[Monorepo 构建]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 运行时组合&#10;        MF[Module Federation]&#10;        Qiankun[qiankun / single-spa]&#10;        IFrame[iframe 隔离]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 服务端组合&#10;        SSI[Server-Side Includes]&#10;        ESI[Edge-Side Includes]&#10;    end&#10;    NpmPkg -.-&gt;|独立性低| Monorepo&#10;    Monorepo -.-&gt;|独立性中| MF&#10;    MF -.-&gt;|独立性高| Qiankun&#10;    Qiankun -.-&gt;|隔离性最强| IFrame\">graph LR\n    subgraph 构建时组合\n        NpmPkg[NPM 包发布]\n        Monorepo[Monorepo 构建]\n    end\n    subgraph 运行时组合\n        MF[Module Federation]\n        Qiankun[qiankun / single-spa]\n        IFrame[iframe 隔离]\n    end\n    subgraph 服务端组合\n        SSI[Server-Side Includes]\n        ESI[Edge-Side Includes]\n    end\n    NpmPkg -.-&gt;|独立性低| Monorepo\n    Monorepo -.-&gt;|独立性中| MF\n    MF -.-&gt;|独立性高| Qiankun\n    Qiankun -.-&gt;|隔离性最强| IFrame</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>独立部署</th>\n<th>框架无关</th>\n<th>隔离性</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n<th>开发体验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NPM 包</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module Federation 2.0</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⚠️（同构建工具）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>qiankun</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>高（JS 沙箱）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>single-spa</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iframe</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"module-federation-2-0-2026-年的首选方案\">Module Federation 2.0：2026 年的首选方案</h2><p>Module Federation 2.0 于 2024 年发布稳定版，由字节跳动 Web Infra 团队主导开发。它在原有 Webpack 5 Module Federation 基础上解决了三大核心痛点：TypeScript 类型共享、动态宿主发现和跨构建工具支持。</p>\n<p><strong>核心改进</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>动态类型提示</strong>：远程模块自动生成并加载 TypeScript 类型，消除 <code>any</code> 类型</li>\n<li><strong>运行时解耦</strong>：MF Runtime 独立于构建工具，支持 Webpack、Rspack、Vite、Rollup</li>\n<li><strong>Manifest 协议</strong>：<code>mf-manifest.json</code> 简化部署平台集成和版本管理</li>\n<li><strong>副作用扫描器</strong>：CLI 工具静态分析构建产物，识别全局变量污染和 CSS 作用域影响</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// Rspack 配置 - Remote 端&#10;import { ModuleFederationPlugin } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/rspack&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;      name: &#39;order_app&#39;,&#10;      exposes: {&#10;        &#39;./OrderList&#39;: &#39;./src/components/OrderList.tsx&#39;,&#10;        &#39;./OrderDetail&#39;: &#39;./src/pages/OrderDetail.tsx&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      shared: {&#10;        react: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^18.0.0&#39; },&#10;        &#39;react-dom&#39;: { singleton: true },&#10;      },&#10;      dts: true, // 自动生成类型声明&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Rspack 配置 - Remote 端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ModuleFederationPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/rspack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exposes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './OrderList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/OrderList.tsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './OrderDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/pages/OrderDetail.tsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        react: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^18.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'react-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动生成类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// Host 端消费远程模块&#10;import { ModuleFederationPlugin } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/rspack&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;      name: &#39;shell_app&#39;,&#10;      remotes: {&#10;        order_app: &#39;order_app@https://cdn.example.com/order/mf-manifest.json&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      shared: {&#10;        react: { singleton: true },&#10;        &#39;react-dom&#39;: { singleton: true },&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Host 端消费远程模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ModuleFederationPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/rspack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shell_app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      remotes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        order_app: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_app@https://cdn.example.com/order/mf-manifest.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        react: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'react-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Rspack + MF2 的性能优势</strong>：Rspack 提供 Webpack 兼容 API 但构建速度快 5-10 倍，使 Module Federation 在大型项目中从&quot;理论可行但构建太慢&quot;变为真正实用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"qiankun-与运行时微前端\">qiankun 与运行时微前端</h2><p>对于需要框架无关和强隔离的场景，qiankun（基于 single-spa）提供了运行时微前端方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { registerMicroApps, start } from &#39;qiankun&#39;;&#10;&#10;registerMicroApps([&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;crm-app&#39;,&#10;    entry: &#39;//cdn.example.com/crm/&#39;,&#10;    container: &#39;#subapp-container&#39;,&#10;    activeRule: &#39;/crm&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;analytics-app&#39;,&#10;    entry: &#39;//cdn.example.com/analytics/&#39;,&#10;    container: &#39;#subapp-container&#39;,&#10;    activeRule: &#39;/analytics&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;]);&#10;&#10;start({ sandbox: { strictStyleIsolation: true } });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { registerMicroApps, start } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'qiankun'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerMicroApps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'crm-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'//cdn.example.com/crm/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    container: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#subapp-container'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    activeRule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/crm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'analytics-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'//cdn.example.com/analytics/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    container: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#subapp-container'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    activeRule: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/analytics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ sandbox: { strictStyleIsolation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>qiankun 的核心能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>JS 沙箱</strong>：Proxy 代理 window 对象，防止子应用间全局变量污染</li>\n<li><strong>CSS 隔离</strong>：Shadow DOM 或 Scoped CSS 防止样式泄漏</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期管理</strong>：标准化的 bootstrap → mount → unmount 流程</li>\n<li><strong>预加载</strong>：空闲时预加载子应用资源，减少切换延迟</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"迁移策略-从-spa-到微前端\">迁移策略：从 SPA 到微前端</h2><p>迁移不是重写——它是在保持业务连续的前提下逐步解耦：</p>\n<h3 id=\"step-1-shell-应用搭建-1-2-周\">Step 1：Shell 应用搭建（1-2 周）</h3><p>创建一个轻量的 Shell/Host 应用，负责全局导航、认证、布局。初始时 Shell 只做路由转发，所有业务逻辑仍在原 SPA 中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph shell[&quot;Shell App&quot;]&#10;        Nav[全局导航]&#10;        Auth[认证模块]&#10;        Layout[页面布局]&#10;        Container[子应用容器]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph legacy[&quot;Legacy SPA - 作为子应用接入&quot;]&#10;        LegacyAll[全部业务功能]&#10;    end&#10;    Container --&gt; LegacyAll\">graph TB\n    subgraph shell[\"Shell App\"]\n        Nav[全局导航]\n        Auth[认证模块]\n        Layout[页面布局]\n        Container[子应用容器]\n    end\n    subgraph legacy[\"Legacy SPA - 作为子应用接入\"]\n        LegacyAll[全部业务功能]\n    end\n    Container --&gt; LegacyAll</pre><h3 id=\"step-2-路由切割-2-4-周-模块\">Step 2：路由切割（2-4 周/模块）</h3><p>将 SPA 按业务域切割为独立子应用。每次切割一个域：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>确定域边界（对应一组 URL 路径）</li>\n<li>将该域的代码抽取为独立的构建产物</li>\n<li>在 Shell 中注册为微前端子应用</li>\n<li>验证功能正常后从原 SPA 中删除对应代码</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"step-3-共享依赖优化-持续\">Step 3：共享依赖优化（持续）</h3><p>通过 Module Federation 的 <code>shared</code> 配置或 Import Maps 实现公共依赖（React、Design System）的单例加载，避免重复打包。</p>\n<h3 id=\"step-4-独立-ci-cd-每个子应用\">Step 4：独立 CI/CD（每个子应用）</h3><p>每个子应用配置独立的构建和部署流水线，实现真正的独立发布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心挑战与解决方案\">核心挑战与解决方案</h2><h3 id=\"状态共享\">状态共享</h3><p>微前端间不应共享运行时状态（否则又形成耦合），但某些全局状态（认证信息、主题、语言）确实需要跨子应用访问：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>耦合度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>URL 参数</td>\n<td>简单状态传递</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CustomEvent</td>\n<td>少量事件通知</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享 Store（External）</td>\n<td>认证、主题等全局状态</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Props 注入</td>\n<td>父子通信</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享 Cookie/LocalStorage</td>\n<td>认证 Token</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心原则：<strong>宁可重复获取数据，也不要共享可变状态</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"样式隔离\">样式隔离</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>隔离强度</th>\n<th>性能影响</th>\n<th>适用框架</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Shadow DOM</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>框架无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS Modules</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>React/Vue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scoped prefix</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS-in-JS 命名空间</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>React</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"路由协调\">路由协调</h3><p>Shell 应用管理一级路由，子应用管理自己的子路由。关键是避免路由冲突和确保浏览器前进/后退正常工作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Shell 路由配置&#10;const routes = [&#10;  { path: &#39;/orders/*&#39;, microApp: &#39;order-app&#39; },&#10;  { path: &#39;/analytics/*&#39;, microApp: &#39;analytics-app&#39; },&#10;  { path: &#39;/settings/*&#39;, microApp: &#39;settings-app&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Shell 路由配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/orders/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, microApp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/analytics/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, microApp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'analytics-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/settings/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, microApp: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'settings-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"何时不采用微前端\">何时不采用微前端</h2><p>微前端不是所有前端问题的解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>团队 &lt; 5 人</strong>：Monorepo + Turborepo 足以管理复杂度</li>\n<li><strong>单一产品线</strong>：没有独立部署需求时，模块化 SPA 更高效</li>\n<li><strong>性能极致要求</strong>：微前端增加 Runtime 开销（远程模块加载、框架初始化）</li>\n<li><strong>高度交互的单页面</strong>：如在线文档编辑器，组件间密切通信，拆分带来的通信成本高于收益</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026 年的务实建议：<strong>先用 Monorepo 管理代码组织，当独立部署成为刚性需求时再引入 Module Federation 实现运行时解耦</strong>。从代码组织优化到架构拆分，中间有很多渐进式的选择点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>微前端是表现层的微服务</strong>：把独立部署与团队自治延伸到前端，回答 SPA 单体的构建、发布与故障扩散瓶颈。</li>\n<li><strong>方案是一条独立性光谱</strong>：NPM 包 / Monorepo（构建时组合）→ Module Federation → qiankun/single-spa → iframe（运行时组合），独立性越高则隔离性与性能开销的取舍越明显。</li>\n<li><strong>Module Federation 2.0 是 2026 首选</strong>：动态类型提示、运行时解耦、Manifest 协议、副作用扫描器，配合 Rspack 构建提速 5-10 倍。</li>\n<li><strong>迁移分四步</strong>：Shell 应用搭建 → 路由切割（每域独立抽取）→ 共享依赖单例优化 → 独立 CI/CD。</li>\n<li><strong>核心挑战有对策</strong>：状态共享&quot;宁可重复获取数据，也不要共享可变状态&quot;，样式隔离选 Shadow DOM/CSS Modules，Shell 管一级路由、子应用管子路由。</li>\n<li><strong>并非所有场景都适用</strong>：团队 &lt; 5 人、单一产品线、性能极致要求或高度交互的单页面不宜引入微前端。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渐进式前端架构迁移","id":"渐进式前端架构迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"前端单体的困境","id":"前端单体的困境"},{"level":2,"text":"微前端的核心模式","id":"微前端的核心模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Module Federation 2.0：2026 年的首选方案","id":"module-federation-2-0-2026-年的首选方案"},{"level":2,"text":"qiankun 与运行时微前端","id":"qiankun-与运行时微前端"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移策略：从 SPA 到微前端","id":"迁移策略-从-spa-到微前端"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 1：Shell 应用搭建（1-2 周）","id":"step-1-shell-应用搭建-1-2-周"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 2：路由切割（2-4 周/模块）","id":"step-2-路由切割-2-4-周-模块"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 3：共享依赖优化（持续）","id":"step-3-共享依赖优化-持续"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 4：独立 CI/CD（每个子应用）","id":"step-4-独立-ci-cd-每个子应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心挑战与解决方案","id":"核心挑战与解决方案"},{"level":3,"text":"状态共享","id":"状态共享"},{"level":3,"text":"样式隔离","id":"样式隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"路由协调","id":"路由协调"},{"level":2,"text":"何时不采用微前端","id":"何时不采用微前端"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据库拆分与数据迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/migration-strategies/database-splitting"},"next":{"title":"全栈可观测性设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-architecture/fullstack-operations/observability-design"}}